1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,390
(Sheldon:)Mommy, why are you crying?

2
00:00:03,390 --> 00:00:06,360
'Cause I'm gonna
miss you, Shelly-bean,

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:09,930
(Sheldon:)even though you creep
the bugeeses out of me.

4
00:00:09,930 --> 00:00:11,810
(Penny:)Okay, I guess
we're improvising now.

5
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,230
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry.

6
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:14,700
(Sheldon:)It's not my fault.

7
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:16,270
(Sheldon:)I'm just incredibly smart,

8
00:00:16,270 --> 00:00:19,770
(Sheldon:)and everyone around here is
dumber than a bag of rocks.

9
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:21,640
(Sheldon:)Oh, now, don't
you start crying.

10
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,120
(Sheldon:)You get in that spaceship.

11
00:00:23,130 --> 00:00:24,740
(Sheldon:)Mommy's late for
Indian bingo.

12
00:00:28,410 --> 00:00:30,110
(Penny(on phone):)Mrs. Cooper, hey, it's Penny.

13
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:32,120
(Penny(on phone):)Yeah, I think I broke your son.

14
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:33,380
(Penny(on phone):)Hey, hold on.

15
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:34,520
(Penny(on phone):)Talk to your mother.

16
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,390
(Sheldon:)Mommy, I love you.

17
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:39,890
(Sheldon:)Don't let Spock take
me to the future!

18
00:00:47,450 --> 00:00:48,180
(Bernadette:)Okay, Raj,

19
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:50,840
(Bernadette:)I know you've been avoiding me
and Howard, and I'm not leaving

20
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:52,370
(Bernadette:)until you tell me
what's going on

21
00:00:52,370 --> 00:01:03,020
(Bernadette:)inside that little head
of yours.

